//@version=6
// ============================================================
// ZoneEngineV2_W08DependencyCarryHarness - W08 B15 W06 dependency carry TradingView probe
//
// Scratch fixtures only (no Main library, no production storage, no market logic); every PASS authority is a published
// export: W08Runtime /4 runShadow / planPass / preflightPass / commitPass (pass.dependencyChangedRootIds),
// dependencyCarryInject, dependencyCarryMerge, and W06 /19 buildComponents. The harness only builds fixture state and
// compares outputs. Tests (first bar):
//   A L7_PARTICIPANT_ZERO_PASS   Core K [100, 120] allocated from winner {1}, its only participation edge detached
//                                (participant 0, the Main Root-retire detach as fixture), then freed by a real F0 / commit
//                                (the free set is a fixture input: production derives it from a Merge relation) ->
//                                carry exactly [1, 2, 5] (old L7 neighborhood [90, 130]); the alloc pass carry too
//   B L7_BOUNDARY_PASS           PCs at 89 / 90 / 130 / 131 around K [100, 120] (mTick 10): 90 and 130 in, 89 and 131 out,
//                                for the new range (alloc) and the old range (free)
//   C MASK0_SEMANTIC_ROOT_PASS   carry [1, 2, 5] into empty seeds: [1, 2, 5] / masks 0, a second inject adds nothing, and
//                                W06 /19 reports no semantic changed Root for them
//   D DEPENDENCY_COMPONENT_REBUILD_PASS  W06 baseline C_old {1, 2, 5} (L7 through K), K freed, mask-0 seeds 1 / 2 / 5 ->
//                                local rebuild {1} + {2, 5} equal to a full W06 rebuild of the same live state; both
//                                rebuilt components reported as semantic changed current components
//   E CARRY_MERGE_PASS           [1, 5, 9] + [2, 5, 8] -> [1, 2, 5, 8, 9]
//   F CARRY_RETRY_PASS           a W06 build failure (capacity below the Root count) keeps the carry; the retry re-injects
//                                the same seeds and succeeds; only then the clear condition holds
//   G SEED_MASK_OR_PASS          semantic seed 2 (mask 4) + carry [1, 2, 5]: one row for 2 keeping mask 4; W06 semantic Roots = [2]
//   H DEPENDENCY_NOOP_PASS       empty merge / inject write nothing; an unchanged continuation pass commits with carry []
// DEPENDENCY_PROBE_PASS = 1 only when all 8 pass (each result is also plotted, data window).
// ============================================================
indicator("ZoneEngineV2_W08DependencyCarryHarness", overlay = false)

import sekine3310/ZoneEngineV2_W06Component_Worker/19 as W06Comp
import sekine3310/ZoneEngineV2_W08Core_Worker/16 as W08Core
import sekine3310/ZoneEngineV2_W08Touch_Worker/3 as W08Touch
import sekine3310/ZoneEngineV2_W08Runtime_Worker/4 as W08Runtime

